  ```
  <<<py addr: header and imports>>>


  <<<py addr: parsing addresses>>>


  <<<py addr: aligning edited files>>>


  <<<py addr: the mapper>>>

  <<<py addr: names and edited files>>>

  <<<py addr: from a generated file to the document>>>

