  The file is its parts, in the order of the source.

  ```
  <<<py litsync: header and constants>>>


  <<<py litsync: the store>>>


  <<<py litsync: protecting edits from tangle>>>
  <<<py litsync: three-way regions>>>


  <<<py litsync: what a decision does>>>
